!!! This page exists to prove the SHORT extension is wired into the compiler
!!! driver, not just the editor. '.mat' and '.matrix' select the same front
!!! end; an unrecognised extension silently routes to the Ny parser, which
!!! reports "Undefined identifier 'book'" and says nothing about the real
!!! problem -- so the selector is worth a test of its own.
!!!
!!! The book is not called "short.ext": "short" is a reserved word (one of the
!!! rejected machine types), which this fixture discovered the hard way.
book brief.extension

greet receives name as text returns text begin paragraph
    give "hello " plus name
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph
    say greet with name being "matrix"
    give 0
end paragraph
